									"key": "availability",
									"value": "upcoming"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Same public search, but `availability=upcoming`: shows published rooms that are currently FULL but have a bed freeing up — each row carries nextAvailableDate (earliest ACTIVE lease end, clamped to now) and upcomingReleaseDates. Use `availability=all` to see everything except MAINTENANCE."
					},
					"response": []
